--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The XRechnung validator configuration
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOT INCLUDED in this repository and NOT covered by either licence above.

scripts/fetch-ruleset.sh downloads it at run time from KoSIT. The rule texts,
the Schematron and the compiled XSLT belong to their respective authors — see
https://github.com/itplr-kosit/validator-configuration-xrechnung and the
third-party artefacts named in its README. Nothing derived from those files is
committed here beyond rule codes, layer names and counts.
